1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,559
To‘qson daqiqa.

2
00:00:01,579 --> 00:00:03,430
Gollarni muxlislar uradi.

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,284
Sakson to‘qqizinchi daqiqa.

4
00:00:05,324 --> 00:00:06,830
Bu golni kim urdi?

5
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,504
Kecha to‘g‘ri topgan uch kishi — ekranda.

6
00:00:09,524 --> 00:00:11,180
Ular final tarkibida.

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,732
O‘ttiz birinchi daqiqa.

8
00:00:12,752 --> 00:00:15,830
Bu golni sahifamizdagi eng faol muxlis urdi.

9
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:18,080
Oltmish to‘qqizinchi — tenglik.

10
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,180
Yetmish to‘qqizinchi — Avangard oldinda.

11
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,280
Va o‘sha zarba — klub asoschisining o‘zi.

12
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,680
Bir — uch.

13
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,980
Prime Avangard — finalda.

14
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,380
Final: Wakanda Team — Prime Avangard.

15
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,080
Finalda ham eng faol muxlis gol uradi.

16
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:39,200
Izohga pozitsiyangizni yozing: darvozabon, himoya, markaz yoki hujum.

17
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,620
Yigirma to‘rt soat, obuna shart.

